      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't think this will be the best idea ever, unless some serious optimization were to happen, both from avatar/world creators and from VRChat. \nCurrently I'd say this would cause too many performance issues.\nIncreasing the limits would probably also make little to no difference to what you mentioned about it being hard to find other users away from the world center.\nMost users would probably still primarily be around the center.",
