      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a7ac88bf5a5c52c08064fb9|full_name}: To be fair, that test died when Poiyomi @'d everyone in their discord and 100+ people joined in at once in their high-poly avatars, and not the test square avatar Table had distributed. That was also before the GC-hangs were substantially improved, resulting in the main thread jamming hard. \nI think it might be worth running that test again with an avatar override to ensure everyone who loads in loads in with a test avatar (Euan said the feature existed but was broken).",
      "viewerReactions": null
